  "statuteText": "259:15 Courtesy Delivery. –\n\n\"Courtesy delivery\" shall mean a delivery made by a dealer registered under the provisions of RSA 261 to a resident of New Hampshire of a motor vehicle sold by an out-of-state dealer."
